Includes all code and data for "Variation in Aboveground Production and Radiation Use Efficiency Across a C₃–C₄ Grassland Gradient in Central North America " 

Scripts: 
"Field data final.R" code for cleaning and analyzing field data, as well as creating figure 2a. 

"ET for RUE - final.R" code for creating aet and transpiration datasets using previously downloaded transp and AET data found in "data" folder. 

"Sentinel ndvi for rue final.R" code for creating fapar variable using sentinal NDVI from google earth engine. 

"PARi for RUE final.R" code for using previously downloaded surface solar radiation downwards to create PARi variables. Also finalizes and creates figures 2 and 3. 

"climate for RUE.R" all climate related data and calculatons 
